{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t中國晚上7時59分在海南商業航天發射場使用長征八號甲運載火箭，成功將衛星互聯網低軌30組衛星發射升空，衛星順利進入預定軌道，發射任務獲得圓滿成功。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：鄭皓璟\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T15:24:07.241479+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":80,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T14:59:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T17:54:17.722363+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T15:17:30.011876+00:00","content_hash":"86eb1e2a61b8e4623ebb4448ccbcf38a5577d8698683a1f08cd4b07c08255730","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}